# R tidyverse style (required)

Follow the [tidyverse style guide](https://style.tidyverse.org) for every R
edit in this repo.

- Prefer tidyverse verbs and the native pipe `|>` (not `%>%`).
- Use 2-space indent, ~80-char lines, `snake_case`, and `<-` assignment.
- Restyle with `styler::style_file()` / `styler::style_dir()`; formatting-only
  changes must not alter behavior.
- Details: `.github/instructions/r-style.instructions.md` and `AGENTS.md`.
